      "body": "Telemetry is a recording of your lap — speed, throttle, brake, and steering at every point. No guesswork. Just what actually happened."
    },
    "step2": {
      "title": "Delta time: your most important number",
      "body": "The delta chart shows whether you're ahead or behind a reference lap at every point on track. Red = losing time. Green = gaining. The goal: push everything green."
    },
    "step3": {
      "title": "The Academy closes the loop",
      "body": "When the analysis finds a problem — say, braking too early in Turn 3 — it links directly to the lesson that explains how to fix it."
    },
    "step4": {
      "title": "It gets smarter every lap",
      "body": "Each lap you upload builds your personal profile. Over time the coach spots patterns: 'You always brake early at Turn 3.' That's when real improvement accelerates."
